WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.134 --> 00:00:10.698
There is so much to see and do at Disneyland.

2
00:00:10.699 --> 00:00:15.101
Have you been to Disneyland?

3
00:00:15.102 --> 00:00:18.145
Mom: Which ride do you want to go on first?

4
00:00:18.146 --> 00:00:20.526
Hana: The roller coaster!

5
00:00:20.527 --> 00:00:25.009
Bada: No, I want to go on the balloon ride!

6
00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:28.003
Mom: We can do both!

7
00:00:28.004 --> 00:00:30.689
Bada: We're up so high!

8
00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:33.186
Hana: I feel like I'm flying.

9
00:00:33.187 --> 00:00:35.303
Mom: Sit down, Hana!

10
00:00:35.304 --> 00:00:39.243
Bada: They look like ants.

11
00:00:39.244 --> 00:00:42.281
Mom: What do you want to ride next?

12
00:00:42.282 --> 00:00:45.335
Hana: Can we ride the bumper cars?

13
00:00:45.336 --> 00:00:49.354
Bada: But I want to see Mickey Mouse!

14
00:00:49.355 --> 00:00:53.716
Mom: I'm sure we'll see him soon, Bada.

15
00:00:53.717 --> 00:00:57.008
Bada: Bam! I got you, Mommy!

16
00:00:57.009 --> 00:00:59.655
Hana: Bam! Look out, Bada!

17
00:00:59.656 --> 00:01:01.866
I'm following you!

18
00:01:01.867 --> 00:01:05.522
Mom: Oh . . . Hana! Here I come!

19
00:01:05.523 --> 00:01:09.775
Hana: Mommy! Let's get Bada!

20
00:01:09.776 --> 00:01:12.479
Mom: Let's have some cotton candy.

21
00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.330
Bada: Yummy! This tastes good.

22
00:01:16.331 --> 00:01:19.195
Hana: Oh, it's so hot!

23
00:01:19.196 --> 00:01:23.428
Mom: I know a great way to cool down!

24
00:01:23.429 --> 00:01:26.777
Hana: Look at the fireworks!

25
00:01:26.778 --> 00:01:30.178
Bada: My ears hurt.

26
00:01:30.179 --> 00:01:32.774
Hana: The show's about to begin.

27
00:01:32.775 --> 00:01:37.622
Mom: Look, Bada! It's Mickey Mouse!

28
00:01:37.623 --> 00:01:44.283
Disneyland is not only fun for children, but it's also fun for adults.

29
00:01:44.284 --> 00:01:47.160
I want to go again!
